WEBVTT

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.270
There's no going back to those days,

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:26.652
but I swear that now,
I'll beat out your sorrow

00:00:28.154 --> 00:00:31.073
| may not overcome it unharmed,

00:00:31.157 --> 00:00:35.912
exhaustively marking the footprints

00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:39.916
of the journey to meet you again

00:00:39.999 --> 00:00:45.922
You once taught me that

00:00:46.005 --> 00:00:51.594
the pounding of the heart
is what drives us on

00:00:51.677 --> 00:00:57.600
They haven't taken our future away,

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:02.271
and knowing that, I can go on

00:01:02.355 --> 00:01:03.564
Just go on

00:01:03.648 --> 00:01:10.404
As long as you smile,
as long as you can sing,

00:01:10.488 --> 00:01:14.575
that becomes everything that I desire

00:01:14.659 --> 00:01:15.284
Wow

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:22.083
The courage you've given me,
the kindness you've shown me,

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:28.297
gives me the strength
to look forward and walk on

00:01:38.683 --> 00:01:40.643
Princess, look!

00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:45.273
The winner will be rewarded with
this feather, which holds power enough

00:01:45.356 --> 00:01:50.236
to provide the amount of electricity
required to run this whole city!

00:01:50.319 --> 00:01:53.239
Come, you racers who have the nerve to try,

00:01:53.322 --> 00:01:58.619
win the upcoming Dragonfly Race,
and get this feather!

00:02:10.673 --> 00:02:12.049
Syaoran-kun!

00:02:21.017 --> 00:02:22.601
Syaoran-kun...

00:02:22.685 --> 00:02:25.980
No need to worry. See?

00:02:41.662 --> 00:02:44.623
Princess, I kept my promise.

00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:46.959
Mm-hmm.

00:02:50.671 --> 00:02:53.466
Oh, not at all bad, for you, kid.

00:03:06.687 --> 00:03:07.938
What's the matter?

00:03:08.022 --> 00:03:09.482
The culprit...

00:03:10.983 --> 00:03:12.485
...is among them.

00:03:15.988 --> 00:03:18.240
Dragonfly Race report!

00:03:18.324 --> 00:03:21.577
We will be bringing
today's drawing to determine

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:25.581
the contestants' starting positions
for the main race to you live!

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:29.502
Now then, will the first
contestant please come forward!

00:03:36.008 --> 00:03:39.595
So, lucky as you are,
which number will you draw?!

00:03:39.678 --> 00:03:41.972
Ready... go!

00:03:43.349 --> 00:03:46.977
One of them is the punk who
interfered with the race, right?

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:52.900
They have to be after Sakura-chan's feather.

00:03:52.983 --> 00:03:55.569
T-There it is, right off the bat!

00:03:55.653 --> 00:03:58.239
The prime starting position has been claimed by

00:03:58.322 --> 00:04:01.575
the Wing Egg's Contestant Sakural!

00:04:01.659 --> 00:04:04.245
Sakura, you're good at this sort of thing, huh?

00:04:04.328 --> 00:04:06.247
Uh-huh...

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.915
What, already?

00:04:07.998 --> 00:04:12.586
Come to mention it, Sakura-chan
does have that unusual power, huh?

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:13.629
Yes.

00:04:20.678 --> 00:04:24.515
| am throwing this party
tonight to congratulate everyone

00:04:24.598 --> 00:04:27.601
on making it to the main race.

00:04:27.685 --> 00:04:31.939
| do hope you will enjoy
yourselves this evening.

00:04:32.022 --> 00:04:36.235
And so, here's wishing for
everyone's victory and glory.

00:04:36.318 --> 00:04:37.945
Cheers!

00:04:39.989 --> 00:04:42.116
That's Mokona's favorite!

00:04:55.337 --> 00:04:59.633
Hey, why do you keep staring at me?

00:05:06.348 --> 00:05:09.643
| like you more and more!

00:05:13.022 --> 00:05:14.940
Don't give up!

00:05:15.024 --> 00:05:18.319
| know someone who looks a lot like you.

00:05:21.322 --> 00:05:25.910
Stop staring, and don't refer
to me like that. It's disgusting.

00:05:25.993 --> 00:05:27.244
Sorry.

00:05:27.328 --> 00:05:32.249
You're a nice guy, huh?

00:05:32.333 --> 00:05:36.587
My name's Ryuo. What's your name?

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.964
Little Doggie.

00:05:40.007 --> 00:05:41.258
Huh?

00:05:41.342 --> 00:05:45.596
It's my nickname. My real name is Syaoran.

00:05:45.679 --> 00:05:48.974
You say the strangest things.

00:05:50.017 --> 00:05:54.271
I'm liking you more and more.
Pleasure to meet you, Little Doggie.

00:05:54.355 --> 00:05:55.648
Mm-hmm.

00:06:16.001 --> 00:06:18.921
All this traveling isn't so bad, is it?

00:06:19.004 --> 00:06:23.926
You get to have cool reunions,
like Syaoran-kun just had.

00:06:24.009 --> 00:06:29.306
However, there are some unwelcome
types among those we meet, too.

00:06:31.684 --> 00:06:36.272
You mean like, for example, those people?

00:06:36.355 --> 00:06:38.649
Princess, watch yourself.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.987
Please look after the Princess!

00:06:52.997 --> 00:06:54.248
Syaoran!

00:06:54.331 --> 00:06:56.917
Kuro-sama, are you sure we shouldn't help?

00:06:57.001 --> 00:06:58.294
Leave him be.

00:07:26.989 --> 00:07:29.950
Whoo! Syaoran-kun, looking good!

00:07:31.994 --> 00:07:33.621
You're pretty good.

00:07:34.997 --> 00:07:36.915
Shogo-san...

00:07:36.999 --> 00:07:39.918
Y-You know my name?

00:07:40.002 --> 00:07:43.255
You only fought back against
the opponents who had weapons.

00:07:43.339 --> 00:07:46.925
And even then, you only went for their hands.

00:07:47.009 --> 00:07:49.595
Who are you people?

00:07:49.678 --> 00:07:51.930
My name is Imonoyama Nokoru.

00:07:52.014 --> 00:07:53.599
Takamura Suou.

00:07:53.682 --> 00:07:55.267
Ijuin Akira.

00:07:55.351 --> 00:08:00.939
| remember you. You two were
in the preliminary race earlier.

00:08:01.023 --> 00:08:04.276
You were together at the party, too, huh?

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.320
Yeah, that's right.

00:08:07.488 --> 00:08:08.906
The truth is, we...

00:08:08.989 --> 00:08:13.619
Beautiful lady, you are surely innocent.

00:08:17.331 --> 00:08:19.958
Who in the world are you all...

00:08:43.023 --> 00:08:44.274
You...

00:08:44.358 --> 00:08:48.237
| am terribly sorry for
being so rough with you.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:51.907
So you were the one pulling
the strings behind the scenes.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.576
I've known Miss Tomoyo since we were both kids.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.578
| would do anything to help her out.

00:08:56.662 --> 00:08:58.914
I'm the leader of a group called the Guardians,

00:08:58.997 --> 00:09:01.917
which keeps the peace in the city.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:05.587
We contacted you today at her request.

00:09:05.671 --> 00:09:09.258
| asked these two to uncover
the truth behind the incident

00:09:09.341 --> 00:09:13.262
that happened during the preliminary.

00:09:13.345 --> 00:09:17.599
You mean, the impropriety
in the preliminary race, right?

00:09:17.683 --> 00:09:19.643
Then you were aware of it?

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:26.275
This was found within the zone
that was set aside for the race track.

00:09:26.358 --> 00:09:29.278
Nanomachines, smaller than the eye can see.

00:09:29.361 --> 00:09:32.239
They can fly about freely through the air,

00:09:32.322 --> 00:09:35.576
and are specially made to seek out heat.

00:09:35.659 --> 00:09:39.955
When these enter the engines
of a Dragonfly through its intakes...

00:09:43.667 --> 00:09:45.586
In our investigation immediately prior,

00:09:45.669 --> 00:09:49.256
we did not discover any
other foreign objects in the air.

00:09:49.339 --> 00:09:52.259
Functionally, even if they
were dispersed from the ground,

00:09:52.342 --> 00:09:56.263
they would not reach the elevation
that the race was taking place at.

00:09:56.346 --> 00:10:01.602
What's more, during the race,
all general machine traffic was restricted.

00:10:01.685 --> 00:10:03.604
Which means...

00:10:03.687 --> 00:10:06.607
It is possible that the culprit
is among the contestants

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:11.278
who passed the preliminary.
That is the conclusion that I have come to.

00:10:11.361 --> 00:10:13.906
| think so, as well.

00:10:13.989 --> 00:10:16.575
When looking through
the contestants' histories,

00:10:16.658 --> 00:10:20.245
you are the only ones who
did not have any past records.

00:10:20.329 --> 00:10:22.915
That is why I turned to these two.

00:10:22.998 --> 00:10:27.252
Then, you had them attack us,
to try to expose who we really are?

00:10:27.336 --> 00:10:30.255
So, have we been cleared of suspicion?

00:10:30.339 --> 00:10:33.258
Yeah. If you were up to anything dishonest,

00:10:33.342 --> 00:10:36.470
you probably would have fought more dirty.

00:10:38.013 --> 00:10:41.642
And, like I said, she was innocent.

00:10:41.725 --> 00:10:44.937
You just have a soft spot for women.

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:49.983
| am just happy for the existence of all women.

00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:56.573
Presently, the company's
investigation unit is looking into those

00:10:56.657 --> 00:10:59.243
who entered the race,
as well as the spectators.

00:10:59.326 --> 00:11:02.246
| will find out who would
have done such a thing,

00:11:02.329 --> 00:11:05.249
and be sure to locate the culprit.

00:11:05.332 --> 00:11:08.919
All of you, please be careful
when taking part in the race, okay?

00:11:09.002 --> 00:11:10.963
| don't get it.

00:11:12.506 --> 00:11:18.136
Did you bring us all the way
over here just to tell us that?

00:11:21.348 --> 00:11:23.642
You're hiding something.

00:11:26.019 --> 00:11:27.938
Actually...

00:11:28.021 --> 00:11:30.983
there is one other thing I would like to ask.

00:11:33.026 --> 00:11:36.280
What are you going
to wear for the main race?

00:11:36.363 --> 00:11:39.575
Your costume! Have you already decided?

00:11:39.658 --> 00:11:40.909
N-No.

00:11:40.993 --> 00:11:44.580
In that case, by all means,
please let me make one for you!

00:11:44.663 --> 00:11:46.915
| have thought up
something absolutely adorable

00:11:46.999 --> 00:11:48.250
that would be perfect on you!

00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:50.919
Wear the costume I make for you,

00:11:51.003 --> 00:11:55.257
and be the dashing heroine, riding
through the sky! It will be magnificent!

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.926
Mokona wants a costume, too!

00:11:58.010 --> 00:11:59.928
You just let me take care of it!

00:12:00.012 --> 00:12:01.930
Still, are you sure?

00:12:02.014 --> 00:12:03.932
Where's the harm?

00:12:04.016 --> 00:12:07.436
As long as she's asking,
have her make you one, Sakura-chan.

00:12:07.519 --> 00:12:09.146
Sakura-chan?

00:12:10.022 --> 00:12:14.151
Would it be okay if |
called you "Sakura-chan," too?

00:12:15.694 --> 00:12:20.240
Of course. Can I call you "Tomoyo-chan," too?

00:12:20.324 --> 00:12:23.243
Yes, of course!

00:12:23.327 --> 00:12:27.581
Isn't that nice?
The cute girls are smiling so widely.

00:12:27.664 --> 00:12:32.252
| am truly happy for the smiles of all women.

00:12:32.336 --> 00:12:34.254
Tomoyo-chan...

00:12:34.338 --> 00:12:35.923
Sakura-chan...

00:12:36.006 --> 00:12:37.466
Tomoyo-chan...

00:12:58.028 --> 00:13:01.907
What do you think? This is the Ryuga.

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:04.242
It has quite a large engine, huh?

00:13:04.326 --> 00:13:09.957
I've tuned it up. I want to
win this race, no matter what.

00:13:12.334 --> 00:13:13.961
What's this part here?

00:13:15.337 --> 00:13:18.256
Don't you know? That's called an EW sensor,

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.926
and it's a device that
detects electromagnetic waves.

00:13:21.009 --> 00:13:22.928
To prevent signal interference,

00:13:23.011 --> 00:13:26.473
all general public vehicles
have to have them equipped.

00:13:27.683 --> 00:13:30.602
But when racing, it's okay to take it out.

00:13:30.686 --> 00:13:34.272
Which is to say, I'm trying
to make it as light as possible.

00:13:34.356 --> 00:13:36.984
Is it okay if I borrow this part?

00:13:38.193 --> 00:13:39.945
You can have it, Doggie.

00:13:40.028 --> 00:13:41.279
You're sure?

00:13:41.363 --> 00:13:46.910
Sure, but I've never heard of anyone
entering a race with it installed.

00:13:46.994 --> 00:13:50.247
You want to win too, don't you? If so...

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:53.583
| want to get that feather,
no matter what it takes.

00:13:53.667 --> 00:13:58.964
That's why you're aiming to win, right?
You say the strangest things.

00:14:16.023 --> 00:14:17.983
Thank you for waiting.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:23.280
Whoo! Sakura-chan, you're so cute!

00:14:23.363 --> 00:14:26.241
Tomoyo made everything by herself.

00:14:26.324 --> 00:14:27.909
It must have been hard to do.

00:14:27.993 --> 00:14:32.247
Not at all. I'm just glad you
wear them as well as you do.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:34.916
What can I do to thank you?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.919
Well, I do have one favor to ask.

00:14:38.003 --> 00:14:39.921
What might that be?

00:14:40.005 --> 00:14:41.256
Your politeness of speech.

00:14:41.339 --> 00:14:44.593
| mean, as long as you are
calling me "Tomoyo-chan" and all,

00:14:44.676 --> 00:14:47.596
| would like for you to speak
in whatever way is easiest for you,

00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:51.266
Sakura-chan, rather than
using such polite speech.

00:14:51.349 --> 00:14:52.934
| am so happy!

00:14:53.018 --> 00:14:54.936
Okay, you too, Tomoyo-chan.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:59.941
This is the way that is easiest
for me to speak. Is that all right?

00:15:00.025 --> 00:15:00.942
You mean it?

00:15:01.026 --> 00:15:01.651
Yes.

00:15:01.693 --> 00:15:03.945
It must be nice, being girls.

00:15:04.029 --> 00:15:07.324
Never mind that, what's happening
with finding the culprit?

00:15:09.326 --> 00:15:12.579
Unfortunately, we have
not discovered who it is.

00:15:12.662 --> 00:15:15.248
We are doing everything
that we can for the security situation,

00:15:15.332 --> 00:15:17.918
but even so, there is no
telling what will happen.

00:15:18.001 --> 00:15:19.920
Please be careful, okay?

00:15:20.003 --> 00:15:20.921
Right.

00:15:21.004 --> 00:15:24.257
No matter who tries what,
we just have to win, right?

00:15:24.341 --> 00:15:25.592
That's right.

00:15:25.675 --> 00:15:27.260
I'll do my best, too!

00:15:27.344 --> 00:15:28.261
Mokona, tool!

00:15:28.345 --> 00:15:31.139
Well then, why don't we get going?

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.645
To the Dragonfly Race main event.

00:15:45.362 --> 00:15:49.658
And so, at last, it's the start
of the Dragonfly Race!

00:15:50.659 --> 00:15:54.246
The rules are very simple!
The one who collects the badges

00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:56.581
from all three checkpoints
along the race's course,

00:15:56.665 --> 00:16:00.252
and reaches the goal first,
will be the winner!

00:16:00.335 --> 00:16:03.922
Just who will be triumphant
in this intense race?!

00:16:04.005 --> 00:16:09.136
Signaling the fateful moment will,
of course, be this lady!

00:16:24.359 --> 00:16:26.611
It's the start of the
Dragonfly Race main event!

00:16:26.695 --> 00:16:30.323
Just who will achieve victory,
and earn the feather?!

00:16:32.325 --> 00:16:35.954
Princess! The race has just started. Stay calm.

00:16:37.038 --> 00:16:39.916
The first hurdle will be a general
public air route obstacle course,

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.627
made up of buildings and signboards!

00:16:50.677 --> 00:16:54.264
Whoa! The Kuro-tan has a close call!

00:16:54.347 --> 00:16:56.600
| told you, stop calling me that!

00:16:56.683 --> 00:16:58.935
Okay, here goes!

00:16:59.019 --> 00:17:02.147
The Tsubame now
demonstrates magnificent piloting!

00:17:11.031 --> 00:17:12.657
Good luck...

00:17:13.992 --> 00:17:15.493
...both of you.

00:17:16.328 --> 00:17:19.581
The lead group has already
arrived at the first checkpoint!

00:17:19.664 --> 00:17:24.920
Here is where they must get the first badge,
or they will be eliminated!

00:17:25.003 --> 00:17:27.589
Where are we supposed to get it from?!

00:17:27.672 --> 00:17:29.299
You don't suppose...

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.303
Huh?

00:17:46.024 --> 00:17:47.943
So that's it.

00:17:48.026 --> 00:17:51.613
It only does that when there are
machines nearby, like we just were.

00:17:51.696 --> 00:17:54.324
The later you are,
the fewer badges there will be,

00:17:54.407 --> 00:17:56.034
and the greater your disadvantage.

00:18:16.346 --> 00:18:18.556
Princess! Reduce your speed!

00:18:19.683 --> 00:18:20.976
Hurry!

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:26.940
Whoa, what's this?!

00:18:27.023 --> 00:18:29.985
An unbelievable accident has just occurred!

00:18:32.362 --> 00:18:33.655
Princess...

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:49.963
Safe!

00:18:52.007 --> 00:18:55.176
The Mokona and the Wing Egg
are undeterred by the accident,

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:58.054
and are able to get their badges!

00:19:05.687 --> 00:19:09.607
Too bad! In last place,
the Nayutaya is unable to get a badge!

00:19:09.691 --> 00:19:12.319
Disappointingly, he will now be retired!

00:19:13.069 --> 00:19:18.616
It would appear that you
have accepted my invitation.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:23.663
And so, the lead group has already
arrived at the second checkpoint!

00:19:25.665 --> 00:19:26.958
Well then...

00:19:28.001 --> 00:19:29.919
...the next move...

00:19:30.003 --> 00:19:32.255
What is that?!

00:19:32.339 --> 00:19:35.258
The second checkpoint is this Dragon Tube!

00:19:35.342 --> 00:19:37.260
By skillfully passing through this Tube,

00:19:37.344 --> 00:19:41.264
you are able to get
the second badge at its exit!

00:19:41.348 --> 00:19:42.265
Those bastards!

00:19:42.349 --> 00:19:45.477
Kuro-sama hates not being first.

00:19:53.693 --> 00:19:56.613
Watch out, this Tube moves!

00:19:56.696 --> 00:19:58.656
Tch, what a pain!

00:20:02.369 --> 00:20:06.331
The Yellow Tiger and the Snow White
are the first to clear it!

00:20:20.345 --> 00:20:22.472
Syaoran-kun! Look!

00:20:23.681 --> 00:20:25.308
Uh oh...

00:20:28.019 --> 00:20:29.312
Fai-san!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:40.949
That was a start. Still, it's lucky
for us this Tube is so elastic.

00:20:41.032 --> 00:20:43.118
Yet another accident has occurred!

00:20:43.201 --> 00:20:45.245
The Tsubame and the Clover drop out!

00:20:45.328 --> 00:20:48.289
There are now nine craft remaining!

00:20:49.332 --> 00:20:50.917
I'm changing the rules.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.920
Please inform the race headquarters
to stop the motion of the Tube,

00:20:54.003 --> 00:20:57.257
and that racers must now only
pass through it to clear it.

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:58.633
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:03.012 --> 00:21:06.933
The last craft, the Wing Egg,
has just cleared the Tube!

00:21:07.016 --> 00:21:08.601
I'm going to make my move to win now.

00:21:08.685 --> 00:21:10.145
Be careful!

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:20.280
Whoa, the Mokona has started to go all-out!

00:21:20.363 --> 00:21:22.615
It has passed the Ryobi
and the Spirit, and is charging

00:21:22.699 --> 00:21:25.660
into the labyrinthine canyons,
where the lead group already is!

00:21:32.333 --> 00:21:33.960
There you are!

00:21:36.337 --> 00:21:40.258
I've been waiting for you,
Doggie. Now, race me!

00:21:40.341 --> 00:21:41.634
Let's go!

00:21:50.351 --> 00:21:55.982
Both of you are well-skilled.
However, that fine skill will prove fatal.

00:21:58.359 --> 00:22:00.945
Ryuo, wait!

00:22:01.029 --> 00:22:02.322
Ryuo!

00:22:03.364 --> 00:22:04.491
What?!

00:22:07.702 --> 00:22:09.329
O-Oh, crap!

00:22:10.663 --> 00:22:11.581
Ryuo!

00:22:11.664 --> 00:22:13.291
Watch out, Doggie!

00:22:18.004 --> 00:22:20.131
Stop! Are you trying to get yourself killed?!

00:22:23.009 --> 00:22:25.136
Stop!!

00:22:26.346 --> 00:22:30.975
Whoa!! The Mokona and the Ryuga have collided!

00:22:36.022 --> 00:22:37.315
Syaoran-kun!

00:22:44.697 --> 00:22:48.660
Syaoran-kun!!

00:23:11.683 --> 00:23:20.233
You haven't yet realized

00:23:20.316 --> 00:23:28.908
that the two of us have the power
to change even yesterday

00:23:28.992 --> 00:23:33.246
For no reason, I'm lonely (lonely)

00:23:33.329 --> 00:23:37.917
With tears streaming down my face

00:23:38.001 --> 00:23:41.588
I'm missing my one and only (only)

00:23:41.671 --> 00:23:49.929
The one I trace out in the sky,
and that's you

00:23:50.013 --> 00:23:55.268
Take my, take my hand,
and let's go on together,

00:23:55.351 --> 00:23:59.564
reach out, reach out your hand,
and catch hold of the wind,

00:23:59.647 --> 00:24:03.901
take my, take my hand,
and do not be afraid,

00:24:03.985 --> 00:24:11.576
hold my, hold my hand,
and I can fly,

00:24:11.659 --> 00:24:16.956
when I'm with you

00:24:32.680 --> 00:24:33.598
Puu!

00:24:33.681 --> 00:24:38.603
The Dragonfly Race is winding up!
Sakura, Kuro-rin, hang in there!

00:24:38.686 --> 00:24:42.607
But be careful. There's a
bad guy out to get you two!

00:24:42.690 --> 00:24:45.943
Eh? What happened to Syaoran after that?

00:24:46.027 --> 00:24:48.279
Just wait until you see!

00:24:48.363 --> 00:24:50.948
Tsubasa Chronicles, "Goal of Glory."

00:24:51.032 --> 00:24:54.661
Next time, your heart will
pound over the second villain!
